{"id": "09", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "TIP", "text": "[softly, glitching] T-tip: Delete the save... and everything goes back to normal. [pause] But no more respawns. Ever."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[panicked] But the talent show is TONIGHT! What if I mess up? In front of EVERYONE?!"}, {"speaker": "IVY", "text": "[warmly] Then you mess up. [pause] With me."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "You looked at all your fails. [pause] Fifty-six crashes. Thirty-one bad jokes. One very surprised goldfish."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[softly] And for the first time... they didn't look embarrassing. [pause] They looked like... trying."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[determined] Okay. [pause] Delete."}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "[calm] Save deleted. [pause] Respawn... disabled."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[unfrozen, confused] \u2014go to the doctor? [pause] Wait. Why am I outside?"}, {"speaker": "TIP", "text": "[softly, fading] TIP: Last tip. [pause] Real life doesn't have checkpoints. [pause] That's what makes it... count."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[quietly] Thanks, Tip."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Lives remaining: one. [pause] Just like everybody else."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 7.84, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 117, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ", "start_time_seconds": 7.84, "end_time_seconds": 12.72, "character_start_index": 117, "character_end_index": 201, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5", "start_time_seconds": 12.72, "end_time_seconds": 15.760000000000002, "character_start_index": 201, "character_end_index": 244, "dialogue_input_index": 2}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 15.760000000000002, "end_time_seconds": 24.160000000000004, "character_start_index": 244, "character_end_index": 351, "dialogue_input_index": 3}, {"voice_id": "